{"id":"7514d356710d2e51","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ntime.md","title":"Nondeterministic Time","display":"df-ntime — Nondeterministic Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-ntime","aliases":["28-df-ntime"],"display":"df-ntime — Nondeterministic Time","depends_on":["[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ntime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ntime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ntime — Nondeterministic Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 是时间界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(N)\">\\(L(N)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；时间是所有计算前缀步数的上确界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\n(L=L(N)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\n(L=L(N)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限上界要求所有分支停机，成员资格由存在接受分支决定。保留常数因子，与原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(t)\">\\(O(t)\\)</span> 约定一致。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义2.5；印刷41页；PDF67页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]